// feedback_source_health: Read producer health independently of selector and control. ENCODER is the running platform encoder batch, IMU_ONLY is physical BMI088 pair availability independent of the one-second estimate, FUSED is the passive fused estimate. Disagreement indicates conflicting observations without assigning sensor blame. HEALTHY means directly usable data. Comparability is separate. Historical provenance remains readable during failure. Reconnect reads board state.
